<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62950" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληπ-τέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμβάνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be taken</i> or
			<i>accepted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				356b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> neut.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληπτέον</span>, <i>one must take
			hold</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				603
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον λ.</span>
			<i>one must undertake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.7.2
			</span></i>; <i>one must assume</i> in arguing, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				61a
			</span></i>; <i>one must take</i> or <i>choose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τούτων ἐπιστάτας λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.1.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. δὲ . . τίνας ὅρους λέγουσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1280a7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must take, receive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμήρους δοτέον καὶ λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					3.2.18
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must submit to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγὰς ὑπὸ τῶν ἀμεινόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					9.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
